The files Seatworks kept in state format 7, as a machine with one project held them. Never edited:
a new format gets its own folder, and state.test.ts carries every folder up to the current one.
Format 7 adds how a project's lanes land on their base: this one lands by merge commit.
Machine files carry the fork's additions as in v4 (queued outbox letters, launch-profile visibility, supervision, dependencies, the sensor budget).
